## # uuid/types
##
## Types and data structures for UUID.
## Part of the Alya Language package ecosystem (https://github.com/alya-lang).
##
## Defines version discriminators and parsed UUID/ULID representations.

## Public enumeration for UUID versions.
##
## Covers the Unknown sentinel plus registered versions 1-8.
pub enum UuidVersion
    Unknown = 0,
    V1 = 1,
    V2 = 2,
    V3 = 3,
    V4 = 4,
    V5 = 5,
    V6 = 6,
    V7 = 7,
    V8 = 8
end

## Parsed UUID struct representation.
##
## ### Fields
## - `raw`: Original UUID string.
## - `version`: `UuidVersion` value detected from the payload.
## - `is_valid`: `1` when the payload is well-formed, `0` otherwise.
## - `bytes`: Array of 16 byte integers (empty when invalid).
pub struct Uuid
    raw: string,
    version: int,
    is_valid: int,
    bytes: array
end

## Parsed ULID struct representation.
##
## ### Fields
## - `raw`: Original ULID string.
## - `timestamp_ms`: Decoded 48-bit millisecond timestamp.
## - `is_valid`: `1` when the payload is well-formed, `0` otherwise.
pub struct UlidInfo
    raw: string,
    timestamp_ms: int,
    is_valid: int
end
